    sits next to it. Relays are scattered across the grid; the dashed slot on
    the left is where a central server would sit, and it is empty. A mailbox
    key (purple diamond) is held by the five relays closest to it, linked by
    net-coloured lines. Those five pulse only without reduced motion. -#}
